# Decision X12 (report 028): no Battery row without a power_supply battery. An AC adapter alone (a desktop PC, a board
# on a USB supply) and an empty power_supply directory (the Pi boards) give the same root menu as before, and no
# battery in the status strip (compare battery_none_mains with battery_none_empty). Review only: no golden.
title settings battery none
review
sizes 640x480 1280x800
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
battery mains
home
shot battery_none_mains
battery off
wait 2100
expect_same battery_none_mains
shot battery_none_empty
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
key ESC
wait 300
battery mains
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
shot settings_battery_none_mains
